              "instruction": "say the Urdu for a father, then the Urdu for dad, then say ammī again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Urdu for a father, then the Urdu for dad, then say *ammī* again]"
